    "text": "Is an abelian minimal normal subgroup A of a group G an elementary p-group\nif the factor-group G/A is a soluble group of finite rank? The answer is affirmative\nunder the additional hypothesis that G/A is locally polycyclic (D. I. Zaitsev, Algebra\nand Logic, 19, no. 2 (1980), 94–105).                                     D. I. Zaitsev",
